{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanks: 1985</strong> is a modern reimagining of the legendary <i>Battle City</i> tank game \u2014 built for both nostalgic players and new fans.<br>Blast through enemies, protect your eagle, and enjoy exciting new features that bring the retro arcade experience to life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>37 Classic Levels</strong> \u2013 Play solo or with a friend in local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Battles</strong> \u2013 Create rooms, invite friends, or jump into Quick Match (with bots if needed).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Maps</strong> \u2013 Design, edit, and play your own maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Shop</strong> \u2013 Buy and sell maps with other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 <strong>New Twists on a Classic</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerup Wheel</strong> \u2013 Spend coins mid-battle to activate shields, speed boosts, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emoji Wheel</strong> \u2013 Send quick emojis like \u201cOK \ud83d\udc4d\u201d, \u201cLaugh \ud83d\ude02\u201d, \u201cAngry \ud83d\ude21\u201d, or \u201c\ud83e\udd85 Defend Eagle\u201d to other players during online matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Economy</strong> \u2013 Earn coins by playing or purchase via Steam microtransactions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Why Tanks: 1985?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic retro graphics with pixel-perfect style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern quality-of-life features (matchmaking, achievements, Steam integration).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thriving community where creativity (map editor) meets competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Whether you\u2019re defending the eagle solo, teaming up with friends, or showing off your custom maps, <i>Tanks: 1985</i> delivers a perfect blend of retro action and modern multiplayer fun.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reach 10000 score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4042460/2eb798a0557a7d5d234986f7ff3eb294ddaa9381.jpg"},{"name":"Reach 20000 score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4042460/2eb798a0557a7d5d234986f7ff3eb294ddaa9381.jpg"},{"name":"Reach 30000 score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4042460/2eb798a0557a7d5d234986f7ff3eb294ddaa9381.jpg"},{"name":"Reach 40000 score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4042460/2eb798a0557a7d5d234986f7ff3eb294ddaa9381.jpg"},{"name":"Reach 50000 score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4042460/2eb798a0557a7d5d234986f7ff3eb294ddaa9381.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042460?t=1761788738","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042460/86547a2a3ca626a633ecdb10c417cea71a7c412e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761788738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042460/977e11503d5a42e93eb0fd5d5ef545380d0c5cce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761788738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042460/977e11503d5a42e93eb0fd5d5ef545380d0c5cce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761788738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements